meta {
  name: auth
}

docs {
  # Account API

  Browser-facing account REST (`/api/auth/*`), mounted only when the server has a
  database. Sessions use a signed, `HttpOnly` cookie managed by Bruno's cookie jar,
  so `register` or `login` must run before `me` / `change-password` / `logout`.

  Run order (`seq`): `register` → `login` → `me` → `change-password` → `logout`.
}
